ugust 1\";Text_Day=\"SATURDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"8月1日\";Text_Day=\"星期六\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"August 2\";Text_Day=\"SUNDAY\";Text_Time=\"Night\"": "Text_Month=\"8月2日\";Text_Day=\"星期日\";Text_Time=\"夜晚\"", "Text_Month=\"August 3\";Text_Day=\"MONDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"8月3日\";Text_Day=\"星期一\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"August 4\";Text_Day=\"TUESDAY\";Text_Time=\"Afternoon\"": "Text_Month=\"8月4日\";Text_Day=\"星期二\";Text_Time=\"下午\"", "Text_Month=\"August 5\";Text_Day=\"WEDNESDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"8月5日\";Text_Day=\"星期三\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"August 6\";Text_Day=\"THURSDAY\";Text_Time=\"Afternoon\"": "Text_Month=\"8月6日\";Text_Day=\"星期四\";Text_Time=\"下午\"", "Text_Month=\"August 7\";Text_Day=\"FRIDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"8月7日\";Text_Day=\"星期五\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"August 8\";Text_Day=\"SATURDAY\";Text_Time=\"Afternoon\"": "Text_Month=\"8月8日\";Text_Day=\"星期六\";Text_Time=\"下午\"", "Text_Month=\"August 9\";Text_Day=\"SUNDAY\";Text_Time=\"Night\"": "Text_Month=\"8月9日\";Text_Day=\"星期日\";Text_Time=\"夜晚\"", "Text_Month=\"June 12\"": "Text_Month=\"6月12日\"", "The type of <color=#7e67b8><b>girl</b></color> that always has the best grades, but never really has any friends.": "那种<color=#7e67b8><b>女生</b></color>——成绩总是最好，却从没什么朋友。", "She seems to have a new sugar daddy every few weeks, some poor old fool that she strings along and milks dry.": "她似乎每隔几周就换一个干爹，都是些被她玩弄、榨干的可怜老蠢货。", "She must be nearing thirty, but all her friends are still in senior high school. It’s more than a little weird.": "她肯定快三十了，可她的朋友还都在念高中。这实在有点诡异。", "Text_Month=\"June 12\";Text_Day=\"FRIDAY\";Text_Time=\"Evening\"": "Text_Month=\"6月12日\";Text_Day=\"星期五\";Text_Time=\"傍晚\"", "Platform = {G_Platform}.": "平台 = {G_Platform}。", "--- END PLATFORM BUTTONS": "--- 平台按钮结束", "Change title screen to version 0": "将标题画面切换为版本 0", "REQUIREMENTS: AOI (ANY), TOMOE 1, SHINYA 1": "解锁条件：葵（任意）、智惠 1、真也 1", "ENDING D - BONUS (can be unlocked alongside A, B or C)": "结局 D - 追加结局（可与 A、B 或 C 同时解锁）", "REQUIREMENTS: TOMOE 1, SHINYA 1": "解锁条件：智惠 1、真也 1", "(THIS SCENE IS INSERTED BEFORE THE OTHER UNLOCKED ENDING)": "（此场景插入在其他已解锁结局之前）", "REQUIREMENTS: AOI 1, TOMOE 1, SHINYA 1": "解锁条件：葵 1、智惠 1、真也 1", "Need to view all CGs in game by following above routes": "需按上述路线通关，以查看游戏内全部 CG", "REQUIREMENTS: AOI 0, TOMOE 1": "解锁条件：葵 0、智惠 1", "REQUIREMENTS: AOI 0, TOMOE 0": "解锁条件：葵 0、智惠 0", "Text_Month=\"January 1\"": "Text_Month=\"1月1日\"", "\"\\>> Downloading image attachment <<\\\"    wait:true waitInput:false": "\"\\>> 正在下载图片附件 <<\\\"    wait:true waitInput:false", "Text_Month=\"September 20\";Text_Day=\"SUNDAY\";Text_Time=\"Evening\"": "Text_Month=\"9月20日\";Text_Day=\"星期日\";Text_Time=\"傍晚\"", "Tomoe = {TomoeRoute} & Shinya = {ShinyaRoute}.": "智惠 = {TomoeRoute} 且 真也 = {ShinyaRoute}。", "Aoi = {AoiRoute} & Tomoe = {TomoeRoute} & Shinya = {ShinyaRoute}.": "葵 = {AoiRoute} 且 智惠 = {TomoeRoute} 且 真也 = {ShinyaRoute}。", "I can be critical about other parts of my body, but I’ll never complain about my wings, caw.": "我可以对身体其他部位挑挑拣拣，但翅膀我绝不会抱怨，嘎。", "With or without feathers, I think they look great, caw caww.": "无论有没有羽毛，我都觉得它们很好看，嘎嘎。", "Mother used to tell me I inherited her wings, and my big sister inherited Father’s wings.": "母亲曾告诉我，我继承了她的翅膀，而姐姐继承了父亲的翅膀。", "Mother doesn’t fly too well anymore, and that might be something I have to also worry about in the future.": "母亲现在飞得不太好，而这可能也是我将来要担心的。", "But for now, my wings are perfect, caw, and I couldn’t be happier with them.": "但至少现在，我的翅膀完美无瑕，嘎，我再也满意不过了。", "My alarm goes off at 6:00am. The early bird catches the worm, after all, caw.": "我的闹钟在早上6点响起。毕竟早起的鸟儿有虫吃，嘎。", "I skip breakfast because I don’t want to get my beak dirty by digging in the dirt.": "我不吃早饭，因为不想在刨土时把喙弄脏。", "The static drone of workspace <color=#b96890><b>noise</b></color> fills my ear holes.": "工作室里<color=#b96890><b>噪音</b></color>的静电嗡鸣灌满了我的耳孔。", "Unlock the bonus ending.": "解锁追加结局。", "Unlock the false ending.": "解锁虚假结局。", "Text_Month=\"September 21\";Text_Day=\"MONDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"9月21日\";Text_Day=\"星期一\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"September 22\";Text_Day=\"TUESDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"9月22日\";Text_Day=\"星期二\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"September 23\";Text_Day=\"WEDNESDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"9月23日\";Text_Day=\"星期三\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Text_Month=\"September 24\";Text_Day=\"THURSDAY\";Text_Time=\"Morning\"": "Text_Month=\"9月24日\";Text_Day=\"星期四\";Text_Time=\"早晨\"", "Scroll Down": "向下滚动", "Scroll Up": "向上滚动", "Master Volume": "主音量", "BGM Volume": "背景音乐音量", "SFX Volume": "音效音量", "Voice Volume": "语音音量", "LAZY STUDENT": "懒散的学生", "TIRED STUDENT": "疲惫的学生", "SECURITY GUARD": "保安", "NEWS ANCHOR": "新闻主播", "UNKNOWN CALLER": "未知来电者", "Mouse Scrollwheel": "鼠标滚轮", "Mouse X": "鼠标 X", "Mouse Y": "鼠标 Y", "Smiling face with smiling eyes": "微笑眯眼脸", "Grinning face": "咧嘴笑脸", "Face with tears of joy": "笑出眼泪的脸", "Skip mode:": "跳过模式：", "Option A": "选项 A", "Option B": "选项 B", "Option C": "选项 C", "Memory usage text": "内存占用文本", "Screen mode:": "画面模式：", "Author Name": "作者名", "Select a script to play": "选择要播放的脚本", "QUICK LOAD": "快速读取", "EXTERNAL SCRIPTS": "外部脚本", "SCRIPT NAVIGATOR": "脚本导航器", "File {N} - {D}": "文件 {N} - {D}", "Music volume:": "音乐音量：", "Effects volume:": "音效音量：", "Choice text": "选项文本", "Master volume:": "主音量：", "Voice volume:": "语音音量：", "Message speed:": "文字速度：", "CG GALLERY": "CG 鉴赏", "Crow Factory Illustration": "乌鸦工厂 插画", "Actor Name": "演员名", "November 21": "11月21日", "Composed by Alec Shea\nLyrics/Vocals - Emi Evans\nPiano - Rob Kovacs\nCello - Mason Lieberman\nMix Engineer - Masahiro Aoki\nScore Engraving Assistance - Thomas Misson": "作曲：Alec Shea\n作词／演唱：Emi Evans\n钢琴：Rob Kovacs\n大提琴：Mason Lieberman\n混音工程：Masahiro Aoki\n总谱刻版协助：Thomas Misson", "RIVER CROW STUDIO": "河流乌鸦工作室", "Font size:": "字体大小：", "Voice language:": "语音语言：", "Kickstarter Backers": "Kickstarter 支持者", "BUY SOUNDTRACK": "购买原声碟", "Soun